"""OpenROAD patches carried until they land upstream.

Applied via git_override(patches = ...) in //:MODULE.bazel. bzlmod
honours overrides only from the root module, so a downstream module's
patches never reach this build -- carrying them here is what makes a
fresh checkout of this branch build the measured toolchain. Each patch
tracks an upstream issue; see the drop-at-bump notes in MODULE.bazel.
"""

exports_files(glob(["*.patch"]))
